  "cnd11:46.5": "sīlabbataṃ vā pi pahāya sabbaṃ ",
  "cnd11:47.1": "anekarūpam pi pahāya sabbaṃ ",
  "cnd11:47.2": "taṇhaṃ pariññāya anāsavāse, ",
  "cnd11:47.3": "te ve ‘narā oghatiṇṇā' ti brūmi.\" ",
